</FONT><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">RSUs with a value of
$0.9
</FONT><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">million and $0.4
</FONT><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">million were granted,
